commit 036a552e6bb314917c3cb0e0653c76cca691e26f
Author: bertoleor <bertoletti3011@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Sep 28 05:44:03 2026 -0300

    feat(booking): client self-service cancel via cancel_my_booking RPC (ORN-84 P1-8)
    
    - New SECURITY DEFINER RPC cancel_my_booking(uuid): ownership by session
      JWT email (bookings has no user_id FK; equality is the relation), typed
      rejects NOT_AUTHORIZED/BOOKING_NOT_FOUND/ALREADY_CLOSED/CANCEL_WINDOW_CLOSED/
      INVALID_INPUT, grants authenticated only (never anon), free-cancel window
      from restaurant_settings.min_advance_minutes (default 240 = 4h).
    - Server action cancelBooking() in bookings.ts with typed result contract,
      uuid shape guard, fail-closed on transport errors (PGRST202 -> RPC_UNAVAILABLE).
    - /mis-reservas/[id] handleCancel wired to the action: the raw .update()
      affected ZERO rows under the staff-only UPDATE policy (silent no-op bug).
    - Also applied pending 20260927000000 calendar-gates migration to live DB
      (was committed but never applied: live RPC ran the pre-2b version).
    - TDD: 10 new tests RED -> GREEN (cancel-booking.test.ts), suite 75/75,
      tsc EXIT:0, eslint scoped EXIT:0, curly fixes on touched page.
    - Live-DB evidence: guarded cast 99:99 -> INVALID_INPUT, 04:00 -> SCHEDULE_CLOSED,
      cancel sin session -> NOT_AUTHORIZED, 0 inserts (5 live bookings intact).
    - RDD receipt 3b53f3251a42 signed over staged diff (9 files).

